* ---- bench: memory / hysteresis (issue #159) ---------------------------
* Two histories in ONE netlist: P (3 strobes at +50 mV, then the probe) and
* N (3 strobes at -50 mV, then the SAME probe grid), each probe on its own
* DUT instance from the same clock and supply. The probe differential for
* instance m is lo + m*step (integer uV); `lo` is looked up per PVT point from
* the committed bracket of the previous round, `step` is the round's fixed
* spacing. The probe actually applied is measured (s_<h>_<m>) and checked
* against the plan, so a wrong lookup rejects the point instead of misreporting.
* clock: 10 ns high, period 30 ns (reset 20 ns);
* decision sampled 9 ns after the fourth rising edge
* (t = 109 ns).
.options reltol=1e-6 vntol=1e-9 abstol=1e-13

vsup  vdd  0 dc 1.2
vclku clku 0 pulse(0 1 10n 100p 100p 10n 30n)
Bclk  clk  0 v = 'v(clku)*v(vdd)'
vcm   cm   0 dc {dut_vcm}
vsw   sw   0 pwl(0 0 80.3n 0 80.4n 1)
vcp   cp   0 dc 0.05
vcn   cn   0 dc -0.05
Btchk tcheck 0 v = 'temper'
BloP   loP   0 v = '-50000'
BloN   loN   0 v = '-50000'

* history P, probe multiplier 0
BsP0 sP0 0 v = 'v(cp)*(1-v(sw)) + (v(loP)+0*10000)*1e-6*v(sw)'
EapP0 apP0 cm sP0 0 0.5
EanP0 anP0 cm sP0 0 -0.5
ibP0  vdd ibnP0 dc {dut_ib}
XP0   apP0 anP0 clk ibnP0 doutP0 doutbP0 vdd 0 comparator_dut
BdP0 dP0 0 v = '(v(doutP0)-v(doutbP0))/v(vdd)'
* history P, probe multiplier 1
BsP1 sP1 0 v = 'v(cp)*(1-v(sw)) + (v(loP)+1*10000)*1e-6*v(sw)'
EapP1 apP1 cm sP1 0 0.5
EanP1 anP1 cm sP1 0 -0.5
ibP1  vdd ibnP1 dc {dut_ib}
XP1   apP1 anP1 clk ibnP1 doutP1 doutbP1 vdd 0 comparator_dut
BdP1 dP1 0 v = '(v(doutP1)-v(doutbP1))/v(vdd)'
